2541	        // prologue that caps the per-tile grid's light causal CTAs; TMA_Q makes the per-item Q reload one
2542	        // cheap async box. An earlier PSTAGES=3 persist lost (0.78-0.82) -- FA3 proves 2 stages suffice and
2543	        // the 3rd stage's 64KB only added smem pressure without deepening useful prefetch.
